{"id":"vod_bf_19971","vodId":"19971","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"恋如雨止","name_cn":"恋如雨止","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-21/9787e1001531bace8a410346a556b1d4.jpg"},"summary":"橘晶（渡部纱弓 配音）拥有着一副冷淡的外表，内心里却是和外表极不相称的天真和单纯。橘曾经是学校田径队的种子选手，却因为种种意外而选择了退出。之后，橘来到了名为“GARDEN”的家庭餐馆打工，餐馆的老板是一个名叫近藤正己（平田广明 配音）的男人，他离过一次婚并且有一个孩子。　　看上去邋里邋遢对什么都不在乎的近藤意外的吸引了橘的注意，渐渐的，橘无可救药的喜欢上了这个年长她28岁的男人。当这份炙热的感情再也无法隐藏之时，橘对近藤表白了，然而，换来的却是对方的拒绝。但橘并没有气馁，她选择以朋友的身份留在近藤的身边，怀揣着小小的期待，期待她如同雨季一样悠长的单恋能够迎来小小的晴天。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:29:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianruyuzhi/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:51.981Z"}